		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>ok merci une petite question <br />a la place je mets $R pour parametrer les schemas ?<br />for s in `echo $r | /usr/local/pgsql/bin/pg_dump bd -Ft -x -O -n $r&#160; -U user&#160; &#160; &gt; /home/moi/$r.tar</p><br /><p>merci <br />#!/bin/sh<br />r=&#039;select nspname from pg_namespace where nspname ;<br />for s in `echo $r | /usr/local/pgsql/bin/pg_dump bd -Ft -x -O -n $r&#160; -U user&#160; &#160; &gt; /home/moi/$r.tar<br />`<br />do echo $s;<br />done;</p>]]></content>
